  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Planning and Reproductive Health - Policy Analysis and System Strengthening</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Planification familiale et sant&#xe9; reproductive - Analyse des politiques et renforcement du syst&#xe8;me</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Family Planning and Reproductive Health - Create an enabling environment for effective FP/RH programs, including policy interventions (advocacy, dialogue, analysis, planning, finance, implementation, multisectoral engagement, attention to equity); organizational capacity building in human and financial resource management, and management and leadership of FP/RH programs. Also included are activities that aim to ensure the near- and long-term availability of high quality temporary and long-acting contraceptives including condoms for family planning and STI prevention, including direct financing, procurement, delivery, quality assurance, and strengthening country supply chains to manage and deliver contraceptives and condoms for public and private services.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Planification familiale et sant&#xe9; reproductive - Cr&#xe9;er un environnement propice &#xe0; des programmes efficaces de PF/SR, y compris des interventions politiques (plaidoyer, dialogue, analyse, planification, financement, mise en &#x153;uvre, engagement multisectoriel, attention &#xe0; l&apos;&#xe9;quit&#xe9;) ; renforcement des capacit&#xe9;s organisationnelles en mati&#xe8;re de gestion des ressources humaines et financi&#xe8;res, ainsi que de gestion et de leadership des programmes de PF/SR. Sont &#xe9;galement incluses les activit&#xe9;s qui visent &#xe0; garantir la disponibilit&#xe9; &#xe0; court et &#xe0; long terme de contraceptifs temporaires et &#xe0; action prolong&#xe9;e de haute qualit&#xe9;, y compris des pr&#xe9;servatifs pour la planification familiale et la pr&#xe9;vention des IST, y compris le financement direct, l&apos;approvisionnement, la livraison, l&apos;assurance qualit&#xe9; et le renforcement des cha&#xee;nes d&apos;approvisionnement nationales pour g&#xe9;rer et fournir des contraceptifs et des pr&#xe9;servatifs aux services publics et priv&#xe9;s.</narrative>
  </description>
